{"title": "Rare Mushroom Subtable", "pageid": 13541, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rare_Mushroom_Subtable", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Leveled drop tables", "Alchemy drop tables", "Subtables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Rare_Mushroom_Table_Auntie_Ethel_Example.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Rare_Mushroom_Table_Auntie_Ethel_Example.png/300px-Rare_Mushroom_Table_Auntie_Ethel_Example.png.webp, /w/images/9/9c/Rare_Mushroom_Table_Auntie_Ethel_Example.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Rare_Mushroom_Table_Auntie_Ethel_Example.png/300px-Rare_Mushroom_Table_Auntie_Ethel_Example.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"319\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9c/Rare_Mushroom_Table_Auntie_Ethel_Example.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>Auntie Ethel's stock, including Rare Mushroom Table rolls.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Rare Mushroom Table</b>, also known as <code>ST_Alchemy_Mushroom_Rare</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ST_Alchemy_Mushroom_Rare+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ST_Alchemy_Mushroom_Rare+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span> is a leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> with various mushroom-like alchemical ingredients on it. It is referenced in many drop tables, particularly as part of the <a href=\"/wiki/Rare_Mushroom_Supply_Table\" title=\"Rare Mushroom Supply Table\">Rare Mushroom Supply Table</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h3>\n<p><i><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Rare Mushroom Subtable}}</code>.</i></i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 1 - 5</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acorn_Truffle\" title=\"Acorn Truffle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png/40px-Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png/60px-Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/11/Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png/40px-Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Acorn_Truffle\" title=\"Acorn Truffle\">Acorn Truffle</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Always</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Level 6+</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acorn_Truffle\" title=\"Acorn Truffle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png/40px-Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png/60px-Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/11/Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png/40px-Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Acorn_Truffle_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Acorn_Truffle\" title=\"Acorn Truffle\">Acorn Truffle</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/4</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nightlight_Frond\" title=\"Nightlight Frond\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Nightlight_Frond_Item_Icon.png/40px-Nightlight_Frond_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Nightlight_Frond_Item_Icon.png/60px-Nightlight_Frond_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f0/Nightlight_Frond_Item_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Nightlight_Frond_Item_Icon.png/40px-Nightlight_Frond_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Nightlight_Frond_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Nightlight_Frond\" title=\"Nightlight Frond\">Nightlight Frond</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/4</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style